  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "lb_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "A perfect loop\n\nTime's `loop` output runs 0 → 1 once per loop length (5 s here: set it in the toolbar's Loop field or File → Export Video / GIF…; it's saved with the patch).\n\nEverything moving is a whole number of turns of `loop`: the ring's wave goes round once, the hues cycle once. So the last frame leads straight back into the first, and an export of one loop repeats seamlessly.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "A perfect loop\n\nTime's `loop` output runs 0 → 1 once per loop length (5 s here: set it in the toolbar's Loop field or File → Export Video / GIF…; it's saved with the patch).\n\nEverything moving is a whole number of turns of `loop`: the ring's wave goes round once, the hues cycle once. So the last frame leads straight back into the first, and an export of one loop repeats seamlessly.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
